><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251110103649+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251110103651+10'00'" name="eb96ad3b-f2a9-49ef-a83e-2b83885520fa" page="14" coords="59.981100,507.592000,433.207000,507.592000,59.981100,495.916000,433.207000,495.916000,59.981100,494.614000,433.187000,494.614000,59.981100,482.938000,433.187000,482.938000,59.981100,481.635000,433.207000,481.635000,59.981100,469.959000,433.207000,469.959000,59.981100,468.594000,433.196000,468.594000,59.981100,456.918000,433.196000,456.918000,59.981100,455.616000,433.197000,455.616000,59.981100,443.940000,433.197000,443.940000,59.981100,442.638000,180.354000,442.638000,59.981100,430.962000,180.354000,430.962000" rect="59.616200,430.597000,433.572000,507.957000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: The use of IMUs presents a viable option to accurately monitor temporal parameters of&#xD;wheelchair propulsion, such as stroke number and push frequency. Greatest accuracy in&#xD;temporal parameter identification was influenced by the SNR of the resultant acceleration&#xD;trace. IMU placement on the frame, and potentially the axle, demonstrated greatest&#xD;accuracy, however, reliability should be suitably high regardless of placement as long as&#xD;the SNR is sufficiently high.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="14" rect="493.228000,415.592000,677.228000,507.592000"
/></highlight
